  "notes": "Compound of {愛|あい} (love) + {護|ご} (protect). Carries a nuance of compassionate protection — not just legal protection, but caring treatment motivated by affection.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {動物|どうぶつ}{愛護|あいご} — animal welfare/protection\n- {愛護|あいご}センター — animal shelter (formally: animal welfare center)\n- {愛護|あいご}{団体|だんたい} — animal welfare organization\n- {動物|どうぶつ}{愛護|あいご}{法|ほう} — Animal Welfare Act\n- {自然|しぜん}{愛護|あいご} — nature conservation\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {保護|ほご} — protection (more general, legal/institutional emphasis)\n- {保全|ほぜん} — conservation, preservation (environmental/ecological)\n- {虐待|ぎゃくたい} — abuse, mistreatment (opposite)",
